---
import DownloadLayout from "@/layouts/DownloadLayout.astro";
import CopyCommand from "@/components/CopyCommand.astro";
---
<DownloadLayout platform="linux" title="Linux" description="Choose an x86_64 AppImage or the package for your distribution. Arch Linux and Nix options are below.">
  <h2>Install the downloaded package</h2><p>Run these commands from the folder containing your download. Match the filename to the asset you downloaded.</p>
  <CopyCommand label="AppImage" command={"chmod +x Refract-Linux-x86_64.AppImage\n./Refract-Linux-x86_64.AppImage"} />
  <CopyCommand label="Debian / Ubuntu" command="sudo apt install ./Refract-Linux-amd64.deb" />
  <CopyCommand label="Fedora" command="sudo dnf install ./Refract-Linux-x86_64.rpm" />
  <h3>Community package options</h3><p>AUR packages and the project Nix flake are separate installation paths. Their versions may differ from the published binaries above.</p>
  <CopyCommand label="Arch Linux · AUR" command="yay -S refract-launcher-bin" />
  <CopyCommand label="Nix project flake" command="nix run github:RefractMC/Refract_MC" />
  <p>See the <a href="https://github.com/RefractMC/Refract_MC/blob/main/docs/PACKAGING.md">project packaging guide</a> for requirements and packaging status. For SteamOS, follow the <a href="/download/steam-deck/">Steam Deck instructions</a>.</p>
</DownloadLayout>
